<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10212"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Newyorker<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Newyorker<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 6:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think Raider could of been posting here .. look at the thread regarding where does BTK live now? It&#39;s from the name Raider and also the last comment is from Raider ... and it was on 02/22 ... ?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
