<!--Post: 10216--><!--Time: 1109820203-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10216"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:vscantu1@msn.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 7:23 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->RAIDER &#40;&#34;Denny The Dog Catcher&#34;?&#41; posted under this subject, &#34;BTK Theories&#34; in the &#39;thread&#39;, &#34;Where BTK Lives Right Now&#34;. Here&#39;s the link, <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/11/547.html?1109819938" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/11/547.htm l?1109819938</a> <BR> <BR>IF RAIDER was BLT, he may have been trying to lead investigators &#40;both amateur &amp; professional&#41; Out-Of-State. <BR> <BR>I&#39;ve asked him to Post again on that thread if it really wasn&#39;t the BLT. And if it WAS BLT....wow! <BR> <BR>Victor<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10216-->
<!--Post: 10219--><!--Time: 1109821115-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10219"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 7:38 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->My sentiments exactly. <BR> <BR>Where are you now RAIDAR?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10219-->
<!--Post: 10333--><!--Time: 1109898690-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10333"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Justathought<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Justathought<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 5:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Holy crap. <BR>Thats no coincidence. <BR>NO WAY<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10333-->
<!--Post: 10340--><!--Time: 1109903032-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10340"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ivy_leaguer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ivy_leaguer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 6:23 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Based on the information made available during the last week its highly likely Dennis Rader may have used the sobriquet Raidar. The suspect&#39;s desire for recognition was so great he did not make a serious attempt to conceal his identity.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10340-->
<!--Post: 10342--><!--Time: 1109903356-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10342"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 6:29 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->It&#39;s hard to say but an argument can be made in favor of it. Among others, I found this interesting: <BR> <BR>&#34;Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 7:02 pm:      <BR> <BR>-------------------------------------------------- ------------------------------ <BR>That is a good point Bmodule. I was just thinkin about the drops he has been doin. I mean he could live 100 or 200 miles away and just drive there to do the drops.Could be Okla. or Mo. i just think there is a chance of this. I do have a few more feelings, <b>just kinda scared to voice my opinion.</b> &#40;Emphasis supplied.&#41; <BR> <BR>RAIDAR&#34; <BR> <BR>He&#39;s &#34;kinda scared&#34; to &#34;voice my opinion?&#34; If this is true, why did RAIDAR <i>create the thread?</i> <BR> <BR>Also this: <BR> <BR>&#34;Posted on Tuesday, February 22, 2005 - 4:49 am:      <BR> <BR>-------------------------------------------------- ------------------------------ <BR>I live in Southeast TX and i watch everything on the news about BTK on my laptop from Wichita News. I even watch my hometown news when im away, so if he is computer savey he can do the same.  <BR> <BR>RAIDAR&#34; <BR> <BR><i>I live in Southeast TX and i watch everything on the news about BTK on my laptop from Wichita News.</i> <BR> <BR>I&#39;m computer-stupid. For someone who would know, does this mean his IP number would indicate &#34;Southeast Texas?&#34; He made at least three posts, which are time and date stamped. If Rader&#39;s whereabouts in Wichita for these dates can be proved, can comparing the data show whether or not the murderer Dennis Rader indeed posted here? <BR> <BR>The biggest thing against him posting here, to me, would be his using a screen name which was so similar to his genuine surname. Nearly a homonym, in fact. But a good argument can be made, those posts are interesting...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10342-->
<!--Post: 10343--><!--Time: 1109903424-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10343"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 6:30 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ivy Leaguer, you beat me to the punch! But then you usually do.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10343-->
<!--Post: 10395--><!--Time: 1109920163-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10395"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lizzie<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lizzie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 11:09 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think maybe he could be his using a screen name which was so similar to his genuine surname. Nearly a homonym, in fact. .Before we knew it was dennis rader, RAIDAR was sort of hiding in plain sight. Like on the word grids.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
